      "source": "The methods of <code>CrudRepository</code> instances are transactional by default.\nFor reading operations, the transaction configuration <code>readOnly</code> flag is set to <code>true</code>.\nAll others are configured with a plain <code>@Transactional</code> annotation so that default transaction configuration applies.\nFor details, see the Javadoc of <code><a class=\"xref attachment apiref\" href=\"../api/java/org/springframework/data/jdbc/repository/support/SimpleJdbcRepository.html\">SimpleJdbcRepository</a></code>.\nIf you need to tweak transaction configuration for one of the methods declared in a repository, redeclare the method in your repository interface, as follows:",
      "translation": "CrudRepository 实例的方法默认具有事务性。  \n对于读取操作，事务配置中的 <code>readOnly</code> 标志设置为 <code>true</code>。  \n其余方法均配置为普通的 <code>@Transactional</code> 注解，以应用默认的事务配置。  \n有关详细信息，请参阅 <code><a class=\"xref attachment apiref\" href=\"../api/java/org/springframework/data/jdbc/repository/support/SimpleJdbcRepository.html\">SimpleJdbcRepository</a></code> 的 Javadoc。  \n如果您需要调整仓库中声明的某个方法的事务配置，请在您的仓库接口中重新声明该方法，如下所示：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Typically, you want the <code>readOnly</code> flag to be set to true, because most of the query methods only read data.\nIn contrast to that, <code>deleteInactiveUsers()</code> uses the <code>@Modifying</code> annotation and overrides the transaction configuration.\nThus, the method is with the <code>readOnly</code> flag set to <code>false</code>.",
      "translation": "通常，您希望将 `readOnly` 标志设置为 true，因为大多数查询方法仅用于读取数据。  \n与此相反，`deleteInactiveUsers()` 使用了 `@Modifying` 注解并覆盖了事务配置。因此，该方法的 `readOnly` 标志被设置为 false。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Spring Data JDBC supports locking on derived query methods.\nTo enable locking on a given derived query method inside a repository, you annotate it with <code>@Lock</code>.\nThe required value of type <code>LockMode</code> offers two values: <code>PESSIMISTIC_READ</code> which guarantees that the data you are reading doesn’t get modified, and <code>PESSIMISTIC_WRITE</code> which obtains a lock to modify the data.\nSome databases do not make this distinction.\nIn that cases both modes are equivalent of <code>PESSIMISTIC_WRITE</code>.",
      "translation": "Spring Data JDBC 支持在派生查询方法上实现锁定。  \n要在仓库中的某个派生查询方法上启用锁定，请使用 <code>@Lock</code> 注解对其进行标记。  \n所需的 <code>LockMode</code> 类型值提供两个选项：<code>PESSIMISTIC_READ</code>，它保证所读取的数据不会被修改；以及 <code>PESSIMISTIC_WRITE</code>，它会获取用于修改数据的锁。  \n某些数据库并不区分这两种模式。  \n在这些情况下，两种模式均等同于 <code>PESSIMISTIC_WRITE</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The preceding example causes calls to <code>addRoleToAllUsers(…)</code> to run inside a transaction (participating in an existing one or creating a new one if none are already running).\nThe transaction configuration for the repositories is neglected, as the outer transaction configuration determines the actual repository to be used.\nNote that you have to explicitly activate <code>&lt;tx:annotation-driven /&gt;</code> or use <code>@EnableTransactionManagement</code> to get annotation-based configuration for facades working.\nNote that the preceding example assumes you use component scanning.",
      "translation": "上述示例会导致对 `<code>addRoleToAllUsers(…)</code>` 的调用在事务内执行（参与已存在的事务，或在没有运行中的事务时创建新事务）。  \n由于外部事务配置决定了实际使用的仓库，因此可以忽略仓库的事务配置。  \n请注意，要使基于注解的配置正常工作，必须显式激活 `<code>&lt;tx:annotation-driven /&gt;</code>` 或使用 `<code>@EnableTransactionManagement</code>`。  \n请注意，上述示例假设您使用了组件扫描。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The preceding causes the <code>findAll()</code> method to be run with a timeout of 10 seconds and without the <code>readOnly</code> flag.",
      "translation": "这导致 `findAll()` 方法以 10 秒的超时时间运行，且不设置 `readOnly` 标志。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "To let your query methods be transactional, use <code>@Transactional</code> at the repository interface you define, as the following example shows:",
      "translation": "若要使查询方法支持事务，请在您定义的仓库接口上使用 `<code>@Transactional</code>` 注解，示例如下：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "As you can see above, the method <code>findByLastname(String lastname)</code> will be executed with a pessimistic read lock.\nIf you are using a database with the MySQL Dialect this will result for example in the following query:",
      "translation": "如上所示，方法 `findByLastname(String lastname)` 将以悲观读锁的方式执行。  \n如果您使用的是支持 MySQL 方言的数据库，这将生成如下查询：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Another way to alter transactional behavior is by using a facade or service implementation that typically covers more than one repository.\nIts purpose is to define transactional boundaries for non-CRUD operations.\nThe following example shows how to create such a facade:",
      "translation": "另一种改变事务行为的方法是使用一个通常涵盖多个仓储的 Facade 或服务实现。其目的是为非 CRUD 操作定义事务边界。以下示例展示了如何创建此类 Facade：",
      "count": 1
    },
